    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7439" root="حذف" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاذِفٌ</span></b>  [act. part. n. of 1]. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هُمْ مَا</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَيْنَ حَاذِفٍ وَ قَاذِفٍ</span>, i. e. [<i>They are partly,</i> or <i>in
part,</i>] <i>beating with the staff,</i> or <i>stick,</i> and [<i>partly,</i>
or <i>in part,</i>] <i>pelting with stones;</i> [or <i>some beating</i>
&amp;c., <i>and the others pelting</i> &amp;c.] (TA in the
present art.; and S and TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قذف</span>, but
without <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَا</span> before <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بين</span>.)

